ngualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"PUMP-HD(TM) contains THE tested form of BETA-ALANINE, CarnoSyn(R), which has been shown in groundbreaking research to be the gold standard form of this compound."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"CarnoSyn(R) is shown to work as a lactic acid buffer, which can help to reduce fatigue and increase exercise capacity. In short, CarnoSyn(R) may help you to train harder and longer. In fact, research shows that a clinical dose (3.2g daily) of CarnoSyn(R) literally builds on the dose before, and that performance can continue to increase with ongoing use."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For maximum benefit from Beta-Alanine, supplement with additional CarnoSyn(R) to the clinical dose level of 3.2g daily."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"PUMP-HD(TM) also includes the most researched form of CREATINE and the key branched chain amino acid LEUCINE. To complete this ADVANCED PRE-WORKOUT formula, we’ve added an ELECTROLYTE matrix to help rehydrate and refresh.*"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Please read entire label before use."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Take one (1) serving (1 scoop) approximately 15-30 minutes prior to training, blended into 8-10 ounces of cold water or beverage, or as suggested by a qualified healthcare practitioner."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warnings: Not intended for use by persons under age 18."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not exceed recommended dose."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Get the consent of a licensed physician before using this product, especially if you are taking medication, have a medical condition, you are pregnant, nursing or thinking about becoming pregnant."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP THIS PRODUCT AND ALL SUPPLEMENTS OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"The recommended serving of this product contains approximately as much caffeine as three cups of coffee."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Caffeine warning: The recommended serving of this product contains approximately as much caffeine as three cups of coffee."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Do not consume caffeine, or combine with synephrine, including but not limited to coffee, tea, soda and other dietary supplements or medications containing phenylephrine or caffeine."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Too much caffeine may cause nervousness, irritability, sleeplessness, and occasionally rapid heartbeat. Discontinue use if you experience dizziness, severe headache, rapid heartbeat or shortness of breath."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Rev. 01-003-PHD014 03/14"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"NO MALTODEXTRIN!\nNO FILLERS!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ULTIMATE PRE-WORKOUT FORMULA*\nPowerful CNS STIMULANT \nIntensity/Energy*"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"AMINOS\nELECTROLYTES"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"30 SERVINGS\nTO BE USED IN CONJUNCTION WITH:\n-STRENGTH / MUSCLE BUILDING PROGRAMS*\n- POWER / ENDURANCE PROGRAMS*\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Natural and Artificial Flavors"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn(R)\nClinically Tested"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"DIETARY SUPPLEMENT"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn(R)\nCarnosine Synthesizer\n"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Licensed under one or more of U.S. Pat. Nos. 5,965,596, 6,426,361, 7,504,376 and 8,067,381, each of which is owned by Natural Alternatives International, Inc. (NAI). NAI is also the owner of the registered trademark CarnoSyn(R)"},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"THESE STATEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN EVALUATED BY THE FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION. THIS PRODUCT IS NOT INTENDED TO DIAGNOSE, TREAT, CURE, OR PREVENT ANY DISEASE."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"When combined with a proper exercise and nutrition regimen. Statements based on early-stage independent 3rd party in vivo and / or in vitro model scientific research data findings for individual ingredients."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ENDURANCE* - POWER* - PRE-WORKOUT* - PERFORMANCE* - STRENGTH* - LEAN MUSCLE*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PRE-WORKOUT"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"PUMP-HD(TM) is our premier PRE-WORKOUT, formulated with researched, trialed and tested ingredients designed to feed your muscles and fuel exercise performance."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Combine this with an ultra strong PRE-WORKOUT ENERGY SYSTEM - the end result can be explosive workouts unlike anything you may have experienced."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2015-03-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":280748,"description":null,"notes":"Niacin (Form: as Nicotinic Acid) ","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":11,"operator":"=","quantity":30,"unit":"mg","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":150,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[],"name":"Niacin","category":"vitamin","ingredientGroup":"N